the truth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191860/extras/87ba44e42006e45f55ddd85dbbfd7859.avif?t=1767700280\" width=680 height=106 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World</h2><br>Get lost in a twisted world that can amaze you with stunning graphics and a lot of bizarre situations, pulling you deeper into a life full of madness. The nightmares (dark entities) will play tricks on your mind and try to hunt you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Core Gameplay</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Search everything (e.g., drawers)<br></li><li>Exploration with puzzle solving<br></li><li>Interact with the dark entities<br></li><li>Pick up key elements and interact with them (e.g., pick up a book and insert it into the drawer)<br></li><li>Interact with the environment (plants, photos, lights, etc.)</li></ul>",
